{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with transformer aggregation, comparing it to the avgpool baseline (config_004). Validation accuracy of 0.653 is slightly higher than config_004's 0.6501, while F1 remains similar. The marginal accuracy improvement suggests transformer aggregation may offer slight benefits, but the F1 score does not confirm this. Uncertainty remains about the optimal aggregation strategy and the potential advantages of integrating image modalities, as this setup excludes image encoders and fusion mechanisms."
}

